    "description": {
      "chat": "",
      "unidentified": "",
      "value": "<p>The living target takes 1d10 damage per round for a number of rounds equal to your caster level; Fortitude halves the damage. If this spell kills the target, you may pay 750 XP while its essence is available to form one soul shard. No XP is paid if the target survives. Creating the shard does not prevent later return to life.</p><p><strong>Automation boundary:</strong> Roll and apply each damage pulse, determine whether this spell caused death, deduct 750 XP only then, and create the soul-shard item manually.</p>"
    },
